 686:Core/Src/main.c **** /** Scales the sine reference before it reaches the modulator. Written from the
 687:Core/Src/main.c ****  *  main loop (SetReferenceMultiplier), read by the 40kHz ISR -- volatile so the
 688:Core/Src/main.c ****  *  ISR cannot cache a stale copy. A 32-bit aligned float is written atomically
 689:Core/Src/main.c ****  *  on Cortex-M4, so the ISR never sees a half-updated value. */
